
Here i will talk about endpoints of drawaria.online, and what they have inside.

// GET endpoints
"/servid" // Dont know, but by name its serving id (not sure)
"/getserverstate" // fast modpanel, explained in modpanel folder
"/getroomlist" // shows data about all public rooms: whos inside and more
"/getrandomavatar" // Getting random avatar, nothing hard, right?
"/gettracklist" // getting track list (soundcloud)
"/searchtrack" // searching track
"/ytlinks.json" // JSON shows old videos which have been recorded by youtubers to show the Drawaria.online, now most of these videos are hidden/deleted for unknown reason
"/countries/:lang.json" // Countries, language
"/announcements/get" // (Somewhere in files i was talking about it as unkown, this is systemmessage3, discovered today in 02 of June, 2026)
"/pageres/bannedwords_*.json" // Banned words (using to blur it with hearts)
"/rules" // rules, read it
"/avatar/cache/:id.jpg" // shows avatar by uid
"/roompreviews/:id.jpg" // shows room canvas by roomid (if timestamp will be added, you can see something like of broadcast)
"/modpanel" // We all know what is this :)
"/gallery/img/:id" // Gallery drawing (changing by id)
"/room/:id" // room, nothing else to see
"/profile/?uid=..." // see profile by uid
"/scoreboards/" // scoreboards
"/gallery/" // gallery
"/gallery/new" // gallery but in this endpoint it shows new drwaings
"/avatar/builder/" // avatar builder
"/rcon/:command" // rcon (admin commands) can be used though url and chat (ive left instructions in modpanel folder)
"/discordlink" // link discord account to your drawaria.online account

